ll_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Void Lore V</a>:</b> Passive: Your Negative Energy and Poison spells gain a 15% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Greater_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Greater False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Greater_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Greater False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +30 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Necromancy Focus I</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Necromancy Focus I</a>:</b> +1 Equipment bonus to the DC of Necromancy spells.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Robe_of_Shadow_(level_16).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Robe_of_Shadow_%28level_16%29.png/420px-Robe_of_Shadow_%28level_16%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"569\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Robe_of_Shadow_%28level_16%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels\" title=\"The Night Revels\">The Night Revels</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Robe_of_Shadow_(level_20)\" title=\"Item:Robe of Shadow (level 20)\">Robe of Shadow (level 20)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This robe is as dark as the night sky and almost seems to crawl visibly with moving shadows. It boosts the power of the wearer's negative energy magic, and grants a measure of necromantic protection against enemy attacks.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816192142\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.114 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.173 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4115/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27961/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7836/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 6/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n103.40%  148.426     50 Template:IO\n100.00%  143.550      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  143.550      1 -total\n 97.52%  139.997      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 35.01%   50.258      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 